OL,3,CMan suffers serious eye injury after
OL,4,Calleged assault at festival
OL,6,FA man has been taken to hospital with
OL,7,Fa serious eye injury after an incident
OL,8,Fat Jersey's Havre des Pas Festival.
OL,10,FOfficers say the alleged attack
OL,11,Fhappened at 9:34pm on Saturday (25
OL,12,FJuly), outside the dance tent, and the
OL,13,Fman is still undergoing treatment at
OL,14,Fthe island's General Hospital.
OL,16,FThey are keen to hear from anyone who
OL,17,Fsaw what they describe as a "serious
OL,18,Fassault" or who witnessed what
OL,19,Fhappened in the moments leading up to
OL,20,Fit and may have photos or videos of
OL,21,Fthe area at the time.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/2
