OL,3,CMan suffers serious eye injury after
OL,4,Calleged assault at festival
OL,6,FPolice say they are particularly
OL,7,Finterested in identifying a broad
OL,8,Fwhite man, believed to be in his early
OL,9,Fto mid-twenties, with short red hair
OL,10,Fin a buzz-cut style.
OL,12,FHe is believed to have been with a
OL,13,Fgroup of other men.
OL,15,FAnyone with information is asked to
OL,16,Fcontact the States of Jersey Police on
OL,17,F01534 612612 or Crimestoppers
OL,18,Fanonymously on 0800 555111.
